                                "sense_id": "39105663-1ae1-36fc-aba9-42276f80de69",
                                "text": "Gusset, pieces of chain mail, tied with points to the \"haustement\" to cover those portions of the body not protected with plate armour; they were usually eight in number, viz. for armpits, […]"
